<title>FRANCE: French housing starts data to end October.</title>
<headline>French housing starts data to end October.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French housing ministry gave the following unadjusted figures on housing starts in October.</p>
<p>			     3-mos to end     12-mos to end</p>
<p>				 Oct 96	   Oct 1996</p>
<p>HOUSING APPROVED</p>
<p> (total nos)		  74,800	  303,100</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  1.9		-8.2</p>
<p> STARTED			66,200	  275,200</p>
<p> (percent)		     -1.6		-7.6</p>
<p>NON-HOUSE BUILDING</p>
<p>APPROVED</p>
<p> (sq metres)		 8.85 million	33.28 million</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -3.1	     -5.9</p>
<p> STARTED		     7.83 million	31.10 million</p>
<p> percent			  -6.6	     -1.2</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
